        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Baldwin RSD, Square Rose Deadbolt</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nA front door lock with something more than the everyday plain style, the Rustic Square Deadbolt with Covered Cylinder is a beautiful example of contemporary design at its best. Choose from either a dark bronze or a white bronze finish. This deadbolt is available in both single cylinder and double cylinder functions. It is backed by the excellent quality for which Baldwin is known, with a 25 year finish warranty and a lifetime mechanical warranty. The Rustic Square deadbolt will fit 2-3/4 inch or 2-3/8 inch backsets on doors 1-3/4 inches to 2-1/2 inches thick.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Traditional Rectangular Covered Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>Baldwin 5 pin C keyway.</li>\r\n<li>2-1/8\" cross bore and 1\" edge bore for latch.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Tested to exceed ANSI/BHMA Grade 2 Security.</li>\r\n<li>Warranty: 25 year finish warranty and a limited lifetime mechanical warranty.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Baldwin Reserve Rustic Square Deadbolt:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Width: 2-9/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Length: 3-1/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Length: 2-5/8\" square</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection, Single Cylinder: 1-7/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Interior Projection, Double Cylinder: 1-1/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: 1-3/4\" - 2\" standard with optional thick door kit for 2\" - 2-1/2\".</li>\r\n<li>Backset: Adjustable for 2-3/4\" or 2-3/8\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder:</b> Deadbolt is operated by a thumbturn on the interior and a key from the exterior</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder:</b> Deadbolt is operated by a key from both the interior and the exterior</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/BAL-Rustic-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354531\" width=\"384\" height=\"176\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Baldwin Reserve Finish Options\">\r\n</p>",
